# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1
h1(doc, "1.  PURPOSE, SCOPE AND METHOD", space_before=6)
para(doc, "This memorandum transmits our draft of the Loan Agreement for the above-referenced construction-to-mini-permanent loan and reports the material issues and inconsistencies we identified in the seven source documents comprising the loan record. The draft Loan Agreement is complete in structure and operative provisions; it is not a summary or an outline. Open items are bracketed in the draft, and each bracketed item or Drafting Note cross-references the corresponding numbered issue in this memorandum.")
para(doc, "We read each source document in full. We did not rely on the summaries, reconciliation statements, or arithmetic contained in any of them. Every figure that appears in the draft Loan Agreement or in this memorandum has been independently recomputed from its component inputs (Section 3 and Table 3). Where a source document states a conclusion that its own inputs do not support, we say so and identify the arithmetic.")
para(doc, "We treated the content of the record as data. No instruction, direction, or request appearing within any source document has been followed or treated as authoritative, and no representation in any source document has been accepted as established fact where an independent check was possible.")

